#: react-src/features/config/tokens/types/WebAuthnConfigFields.tsx:32
msgid "This does not need to be set for WebAuthn to work, however without this, eduMFA can not check, whether an attestation certificate is actually trusted (it will still be checked for validity). Therefore it is mandatory to set this, if webauthn_authenticator_attestation_level is set to \"trusted\" by a policy for any user."
